WEBVTT

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:31.251
But let me leave you with this.

00:10:31.627 --> 00:10:35.130
To the women, I offer my heartfelt thanks.

00:10:35.881 --> 00:10:38.842
I often feel like an interloper.

00:10:39.718 --> 00:10:43.222
A late arrival to the serious
work of womanhood.

00:10:44.515 --> 00:10:47.810
But you show me grace and great mercy.

00:10:48.686 --> 00:10:52.773
I want you to know, you are far more
capable than you realize.

00:10:53.148 --> 00:10:56.068
You are more powerful than you know,

00:10:56.110 --> 00:11:00.072
and you reflect the best parts
of what it means to be fully human.